===See also===
* {{pedia|Palliative care}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{context|medicine|lang=en}} Something that [[palliate]]s, particularly a palliative [[medicine]].
#: ''The radiation and chemotherapy were only '''palliatives'''.''

